<h1>Challenge a judgment</h1>
<p class="emst-lede">If a task, indicator, crosswalk or label looks wrong, tell us. Challenges from practitioners are how the taxonomy improves.</p>
<ol class="usa-process-list">
  <li class="usa-process-list__item"><p class="usa-process-list__heading">Copy the record ID</p><p>Every task, competency and drawer shows an ID such as <code>seed:DB-C09</code>. Copy it, with the release ID <code>{{ emst.release.id }}</code>.</p></li>
  <li class="usa-process-list__item"><p class="usa-process-list__heading">Say what is wrong and what would be right</p><p>Describe the work as you see it. Please do not include names, contact details or anything about identifiable people.</p></li>
  <li class="usa-process-list__item"><p class="usa-process-list__heading">Send it through the project's change-request route</p><p>Use the contribution and change-request guide in the EMST repository (<code>docs/governance/CONTRIBUTING.md</code>). If you use GitHub, note that it is a third-party service with its own terms; agency staff should check their agency's policy first. This explorer itself sends nothing and has no feedback form.</p></li>
</ol>
